n_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-01-14T02:58:49Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:37:19Z","closed_at":"2025-09-30T23:39:00Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101521","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101521","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101521.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101521.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-30T23:39:00Z"},"body":"- closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9685\r\n- closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10802\r\n- closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5868\r\n\r\nAdds Bounding Box, Capsule, Cylinder, Sphere, and Primitive options. \r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7d7ba100-21c8-49e4-badf-839bf6aa6d9f)\r\n\r\nThe primitive option is only enabled when a supported PrimitiveMesh is selected. This will make the corresponding collision shape. When multiple meshes are selected, each PrimitiveMesh will create their own shape and all others will do nothing.\r\nThe other options first check for their corresponding PrimitiveMesh, and if it is not found the mesh AABB is used instead.\r\nI didn't call the Bounding Box option AABB since we don't have an AABB collision shape type. It uses a box and it may be rotated so I thought it could be misleading.\r\nI made sure that the collision shape node will be offset to match the AABB.\r\nThe sphere radius is based on the longest axis. \r\n\r\nWhen Capsule or Cylinder is selected an axis option will show, to allow you to configure the long axis of it. The longest axis is the default. I could add a shortest axis option if it is wanted.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70d1b3f4-acb6-416d-b139-987b94e0962a)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101521/reactions","total_count":17,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":6,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101521/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}